# Domain scope (always)

- One session → one package (`packages/<one>` or `extensions/agent-k`). See root `AGENTS.md`.
- Start with a Feature ID from `docs/V3_WORK_ORDER.md`.
- Cross boundary → change `packages/shared` first.
- Do not publish npm libs unless reuse across apps is explicit.
- Enforce R-001…R-005. No cycles.
- Reference code: read `v2.1-PRODUCTION-MODE` only; write only on `v3.0`.
- **Port maximally from v2.1** for the Feature (`git show` / worktree): real logic, guards, tests — not stub-only `[x]`. No whole-tree `src/` copy. Details: `docs/V3_WORK_PLAN.md` §3 / §3.1.
